OL,3,GNEWSADeaf groups unite under new county
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new charity has been set up to work
OL,7,Ftogether on behalf of deaf people after
OL,8,Fa previous support organisation closed.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Deaf Partnership was
OL,11,Fcreated following the closure of
OL,12,Fcounty-based Deafconnect earlier than
OL,13,Fplanned at the end of March.
OL,15,FIt brings together four existing
OL,16,Fdeaf-led organisations under one
OL,17,Fumbrella, said Michelle Keers, who
OL,18,Fpreviously set up Deaf First CIC.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
