OL,3,GNEWSADeaf groups unite under new county
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being deaf is a hidden disability, but
OL,7,Fdeaf people might need sign language or
OL,8,Fhave a hearing aid or are able to use
OL,9,Fspeech - we're here to support them
OL,10,Fregardless of their deafness," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
